{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You\u2019ve fallen to the other side of the puddle\u2026 Who\u2019s waiting for you there?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this short but intense story, you\u2019ll face the most unexpected betrayal\u2014your own shoes turning against you. You\u2019re surrounded by shadows of the past, the mysteries of this strange world, and perhaps your own repressed memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547310/extras/sh.png?t=1743801513\" /><strong>\u2014\u00a0</strong>Hey, I'm Righty, and I mean no harm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened here? Who are you, really? To uncover the truth, you\u2019ll have to piece it together\u2014literally. But be careful: reality may be far more terrifying than it seems\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only have <strong>one life</strong>\u2014pay close attention to details, listen to the sounds around you, and don\u2019t even trust your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game blends a <strong>fast-paced narrative</strong>, <strong>unusual minigames</strong>, and a <strong>striking visual style</strong>, while the eerie soundtrack fully immerses you in the unsettling world of the <strong>wet puddle</strong>. Do you dare to look beneath its surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547310/extras/lihr1.png?t=1743801513\" />  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547310?t=1743801513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547310/7c403d6395b0424e2cab6a8270e063972bcf9b5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743801513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547310/182129a641c3b4981d70fd972b05a2365ddd22d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=174380